      "description": "Local list search, with the preview’s icon inset and capped flexible field.",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-search\"><svg class=\"ds-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 3a7 7 0 1 0 0 14 7 7 0 0 0 0-14 M15 15l6 6\"></path></svg><input class=\"ds-search-input\" aria-label=\"Tìm kiếm\" placeholder=\"Tìm đơn hàng, sản phẩm, Article...\"></label>",
      "css": ".ds-search{font-family:Inter,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;border:1px solid var(--line,#dce2ea);border-radius:6px;background:var(--surface,#fff);padding-left:11px;flex:1;max-width:440px;color:var(--muted,#5d6a7b)}.ds-search-input{font-family:Inter,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:var(--ink,#172537);border:0;background:transparent;flex:1;min-width:0;border-radius:6px;padding:9px 10px}.ds-search-input::placeholder{color:var(--muted,#5d6a7b)}.ds-search-input:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #3575d3;outline-offset:0}.ds-icon{width:18px;height:18px;flex:none;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.6;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Navigation Row",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "navigation",
      "description": "Flat rail destinations with the selected weight and blue fill; hover uses the neutral fill.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\" aria-label=\"Ví dụ điều hướng\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-nav-button ds-nav-active\" aria-current=\"page\"><svg class=\"ds-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 10 12 3l9 7v10H3z M9 20v-7h6v7\"></path></svg>Tổng quan</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-nav-button\"><svg class=\"ds-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 5h11v12H3z M14 9h4l3 4v4h-7 M7 20a2 2 0 1 0 0-4 2 2 0 0 0 0 4 M17 20a2 2 0 1 0 0-4 2 2 0 0 0 0 4\"></path></svg>Đóng hàng FBS</button></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{width:172px;background:var(--nav,#f9fafc);color:var(--ink,#172537)}.ds-nav-button{font-family:Inter,Arial,sans-serif;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;cursor:pointer;width:100%;border:0;border-radius:6px;background:transparent;color:inherit;justify-content:flex-start;padding:10px 12px;margin-bottom:3px;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;gap:11px;min-height:38px;white-space:nowrap}.ds-nav-active{color:var(--selected-ink,#174b9a);background:var(--selected,#e8f0ff);font-weight:700}.ds-nav-button:hover{background:var(--soft,#eef2f6)}.ds-nav-button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #3575d3;outline-offset:3px}.ds-icon{width:18px;height:18px;flex:none;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.6;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Marketplace Tag",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "marketplace-tag",
      "description": "A non-interactive marketplace label carried inside the store selector.",
      "html": "<span class=\"ds-market\">OZON</span>",
      "css": ".ds-market{font-family:Inter,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:10px;padding:3px 5px;background:var(--selected,#e8f0ff);color:var(--selected-ink,#174b9a);border-radius:3px;letter-spacing:.04em;font-weight:700}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Data Sheet",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "data-sheet",
      "description": "The table container with a sticky heading, selected row and aligned synthetic prices; this sample isolates the container from product thumbnails.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-sheet\"><table class=\"ds-table\"><thead class=\"ds-thead\"><tr><th class=\"ds-th\">Đơn hàng</th><th class=\"ds-th\">Sản phẩm</th><th class=\"ds-th ds-price\">Giá</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"ds-row ds-selected\"><td class=\"ds-td\">DEMO-0101-1</td><td class=\"ds-td\">Костюм спортивный</td><td class=\"ds-td ds-price\">1290 ₽</td></tr><tr class=\"ds-row\"><td class=\"ds-td\">DEMO-0102-1</td><td class=\"ds-td\">Брюки спортивные</td><td class=\"ds-td ds-price\">850 ₽</td></tr></tbody></table></div>",
      "css": ".ds-sheet{font-family:Inter,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;color:var(--ink,#172537);flex:1;min-height:0;overflow:auto;border:1px solid var(--line,#dce2ea);border-radius:8px;background:var(--surface,#fff)}.ds-table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;table-layout:fixed;text-align:left}.ds-thead{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:1;background:var(--nav,#f9fafc)}.ds-th{height:42px;color:var(--muted,#5d6a7b);font-size:12px;font-weight:500;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line,#dce2ea);padding:10px 12px}.ds-td{height:71px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line,#dce2ea);padding:9px 12px;vertical-align:middle}.ds-row:last-child .ds-td{border-bottom:0}.ds-row:hover{background:var(--soft,#eef2f6)}.ds-row.ds-selected{background:var(--selected,#e8f0ff)}.ds-price{text-align:right;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap}.ds-th.ds-price{font-size:12px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Store Management Popover",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "store-popover",
      "description": "The signature local overlay beside the active store. This specimen uses normal flow; the preview places it at fixed header coordinates.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-store-popover\" aria-label=\"Quản lý cửa hàng\"><p class=\"ds-store-copy\">Cửa hàng đang chọn<br><strong class=\"ds-store-name\">Cửa hàng minh họa</strong></p><button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-store-action\"><svg class=\"ds-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m14 4 6 6 M4 15 16 3l5 5L9 20H4z\"></path></svg>Chỉnh sửa cửa hàng</button><div class=\"ds-store-rule\"></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-store-action\"><svg class=\"ds-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 4v16 M4 12h16\"></path></svg>Thêm cửa hàng</button></section>",
      "css": ".ds-store-popover{font-family:Inter,Arial,sans-serif;width:280px;padding:8px;background:var(--surface,#fff);color:var(--ink,#172537);border:1px solid var(--line,#dce2ea);border-radius:8px;box-shadow:0 10px 30px #0003}.ds-store-copy{margin:0;padding:10px 10px 14px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--muted,#5d6a7b);font-size:12px}.ds-store-name{color:var(--ink,#172537)}.ds-store-action{font-family:Inter,Arial,sans-serif;cursor:pointer;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;width:100%;border:0;justify-content:flex-start;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;padding:11px 10px;min-height:36px;white-space:nowrap;border-radius:6px;background:var(--surface,#fff);color:var(--ink,#172537)}.ds-store-action:hover{background:var(--soft,#eef2f6)}.ds-store-action:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #3575d3;outline-offset:3px}.ds-store-rule{height:1px;background:var(--line,#dce2ea);margin:7px}.ds-icon{width:18px;height:18px;flex:none;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.6;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:no-preference){.ds-store-popover{animation:ds-store-reveal .16s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1)}@keyframes ds-store-reveal{from{clip-path:inset(0 0 15% 0);transform:translateY(-4px)}to{clip-path:inset(0);transform:translateY(0)}}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Selection Checkbox",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "selection-checkbox",
      "description": "An actual checkbox with checked and indeterminate CSS. The preview sets the indeterminate DOM property when only part of the filtered result is selected.",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-selection\"><input class=\"ds-checkbox\" type=\"checkbox\" checked aria-label=\"Chọn đơn minh họa\">Chọn đơn minh họa</label>",
      "css": ".ds-selection{font-family:Inter,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:var(--ink,#172537);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px}.ds-checkbox{appearance:none;width:17px;height:17px;padding:0;flex:none;border:1.5px solid #8190a2;vertical-align:middle;border-radius:4px;cursor:pointer;background:var(--surface,#fff)}.ds-checkbox:checked,.ds-checkbox:indeterminate{background:var(--accent,#175bc5);border-color:var(--accent,#175bc5);position:relative}.ds-checkbox:checked:after{content:\"\";position:absolute;left:4px;top:1px;width:5px;height:9px;border:solid white;border-width:0 2px 2px 0;transform:rotate(45deg)}.ds-checkbox:indeterminate:after{content:\"\";position:absolute;left:3px;top:6px;width:8px;height:2px;background:white;border:0;transform:none}.ds-checkbox:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #3575d3;outline-offset:3px}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Dispatch Workbench",
    "overview": "Dispatch Workbench is the proposed visual direction for VN Code's separate HTML desktop preview. It is a **PROPOSAL awaiting user screenshot approval**, with synthetic store, order and product data. The calm white and graphite surfaces, restrained blue selection, fine rules and bundled Inter typography support a compact, readable workspace for Vietnamese-speaking sellers and warehouse staff.\n\nThe component character is precise and restrained: flat controls, clear text states, inset data sheets and a small store-management popover. Light and dark themes share the same structure. This document governs only the preview directory; [the incumbent workspace system](../../vncode-workspace-system.md) remains the production design authority. The current [index.html](index.html) is a code-led desktop visual mock, not the JavaFX application runtime or an implementation approval.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Neutral white and graphite grounds with one blue action and selection family.",
      "Dense, legible lists with tabular numbers and persistent batch controls.",
      "Flat navigation and fine dividers; elevation reserved for temporary overlays.",
      "Visible store identity and management controls, with a named delete confirmation.",
      "Locally served Inter, line icons, and labelled synthetic content in both themes."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Written State Rule",
        "body": "Every status dot appears with a readable status label; color alone does not name the state.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Number Column Rule",
        "body": "Use tabular numerals throughout the preview and right-align prices so batch values can be scanned vertically.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Temporary Layer Rule",
        "body": "Reserve shadows for overlays; use tonal surfaces and rules for persistent workspace structure.",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "**Do** use the shared semantic roles in both preview themes.",
      "**Do** keep tabular numbers, right-aligned prices and written status labels.",
      "**Do** keep table scrolling inside the sheet and batch actions in the separate footer.",
      "**Do** retain visible store identity, management access and a named delete confirmation.",
      "**Do** use locally served Inter and labelled synthetic examples with recorded image provenance."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "**Don't** treat this proposal or the finish-review verdict as user screenshot approval or native implementation readiness.",
      "**Don't** restore the three overview counters or reserve their empty card band in this preview.",
      "**Don't** displace the header's store controls with the former FBS delay text.",
      "**Don't** claim local simulations, tab counts or dropdown samples are live marketplace behavior.",
      "**Don't** infer mobile support from the compact desktop breakpoint."
    ]
  }
}
